---
/**
 * Loads the motion layer (src/scripts/motion-layer.ts): the one script entry per page for every
 * motion feature — the Motion toggle chips, the hero instrument, card spotlights and section
 * heading decrypts (interactions spec §1–§3). Render it from any component that needs the layer;
 * Astro emits a component's script once per page however often it renders, so a page gets a
 * single request no matter how many components ask for it — and a page without any gets none.
 */
---

<script src="../scripts/motion-layer.ts"></script>
